review_text:
Love the vibes here… really new place. Rabi was incredible. Felt like a VIP! He made an English breakfast especially for me… toast, jam, butter, Cappacino, omelette, some unbelievable fruit platter and tomatoes. I came back in the evening for a chicken pizza 🍕 and again he was treating me with royalty. Recommend Chez Mom as a quiet working space in the daytime away from the hustle and bustle of the main road and also for some relaxing vibes in the evening and chilled music. It’s quiet, but this is because it’s new. I’m sure it will do really well in the future 🌟.

💌 insta
